# CLS prototype — provider is the Vercel AI SDK pointed at a backend.
# Swap backends by editing src/llm/index.ts. "Abstraction first."

# OpenCode "go" — cheap OpenAI-compatible gateway (the current backend).
# Subscribe + get a key at https://opencode.ai/docs/go/
# OPENCODE_API_KEY=...
# OPENCODE_TUTOR_MODEL=glm-5.2               # optional override (see /v1/models)
# OPENCODE_ANALYZER_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash  # optional override (see /v1/models)

# Supabase — auth (Google sign-in) and the profiles database.
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com/dashboard
# 2. Authentication > Providers: enable Google with a Google Cloud OAuth client
#    (its authorized redirect URI is https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback)
# 3. Authentication > URL Configuration: allow http://localhost:3000/auth/callback
# 4. Run supabase/migrations/20260804000000_create_profiles.sql in the SQL editor
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=...
